\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. When our heads are bowed with woe,
\par When our bitter tears o'erflow,
\par When we mourn the lost, the dear,
\par Jesu, Son of Mary, hear.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When the heart is sad within
\par With the thought of all its sin,
\par When the spirit shrinks with fear,
\par Jesu, Son of Mary, hear.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou our throbbing flesh hast worn,
\par Thou our mortal griefs hast borne,
\par Thou hast shed the human tear;
\par Jesu, Son of Mary, hear.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Thou hast bowed the dying head,
\par Thou the blood of life hast shed,
\par Thou hast filled a mortal bier;
\par Jesu, Son of Mary, hear.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2 
\par }

